-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Quote Sales SalesQuote To ToDate Total\">Total amount of the sales quote</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Status\">Status</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Status\">Status</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Accepted Active Automatic Cancel Cancelled Code Expired Invoice Is On Quote Sales SalesInvoice SalesOrder SalesQuote Status To ToDate\">The status of a sales quote can be <code>Active</code>, <code>Accepted</code>, <code>Cancelled</code>, or <code>Expired</code>. The status automatically changes to <code>Accepted</code> when the sales quote is linked to at least one <code>Sales Order</code> or <code>Sales Invoice</code>.</p></div></details>",
